[{"id":"playwright-xdist-session","type":"choice","priority":3,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["pytest-xdist","并行"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十)调试与交付.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十)调试与交付","articlePath":"posts/23096463/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>启用 pytest-xdist 后，Session 级 Fixture 通常执行多少次？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>B\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>xdist worker 是独立进程，各自拥有 Session 生命周期，因此共享外部资源仍需唯一命名、锁或专用隔离。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["B"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>整台机器只执行一次\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>每个 worker 各执行一次\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>每条测试执行一次\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"python-env-implementation","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","CPython","解释器"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(二)运行环境与代码组织.md","articleTitle":"Python(二)运行环境与代码组织","articlePath":"posts/5891c180/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>Python、CPython 与当前解释器版本分别指什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>Python 是语言与规范；CPython 是一种实现；当前解释器版本是实际执行代码的运行时版本。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>语言规则不等于某个实现的优化或内部行为。写业务代码先依赖语言保证；讨论 GIL、引用计数、字节码或对象缓存时，再标明 CPython 与具体版本。用 \u003ccode>platform.python_implementation()\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>sys.version\u003c/code> 检查当前运行时。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"python-error-context","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Python 基础","tags":["Python","with","上下文管理","资源"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(八)异常、上下文与文件.md","articleTitle":"Python(八)异常、上下文与文件","articlePath":"posts/c31bf4bb/"},{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/python/Python(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Python(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/c55cda53/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>with\u003c/code> 解决什么问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它保证进入后的退出清理在成功、异常和提前返回时都执行。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>文件、锁、事务和临时目录都应由明确的所有者使用上下文管理。退出方法只有完整处理异常时才应抑制它，否则应让异常继续传播以保持失败可见。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]